{"study_accession":"PRJNA1011265","secondary_study_accession":"SRP457812","title":"Alternations in gut microbiota and host transcriptome of patients with coronary artery disease [RNA-seq]","description":"Coronary artery disease (CAD) is a widespread heart condition caused by atherosclerosis and influences millions of people worldwide. Early detection of CAD is challenging due to the lack of specific biomarkers. The gut microbiota and host-microbiota interactions have been well documented to affect human health. However, investigation that reveals the role of gut microbes in CAD is still limited. This study aims to uncover the synergistic effects of host genes and gut microbes associated with CAD through integrative genomic analyses. Overall design: We collected fecal and blood samples from CAD patients and matched controls,uncover the synergistic effects of host genes and gut microbes associated with CAD through integrative genomic analyses.","pubmed":"37924005","geo_series":"","n_samples":50,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN37214728","study_accession":"PRJNA1011265","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"control [1339346n]","description":"control [1339346n]","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7748010","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2023-10-29","attributes":[["source_name","blood"],["tissue","blood"],["subject status","control"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR25836900","experiment_accession":"SRX21558438","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":21274939,"base_count":6382481700,"first_public":"2023-10-29","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM7748010: control [1339346n] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN37214729","study_accession":"PRJNA1011265","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"control [1336408n]","